From: maxpotoka <maxpotoka@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:13:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Compact cloud connection dialog, replace existing remote,
 show free space

- gui/dialogs.py: compact rclone connection window (status line, progress,
  copy link, details on demand, token masked, auto-close on success);
  ask to replace an existing remote instead of refusing.
- core/cloud.py: check_rclone_remote() returns total/used/free via one
  "rclone about --json" call (falls back to lsd).
- gui/dialogs.py: connection test shows free space and warns below 1 GB.
- core/i18n.py: English strings for the new texts.

